ring for Email (for simplicity that's all an Address has)   A Student \"has a\" CreditsEarned property 10 pts: A Student \"has a\" Gpa property that can express overall grades with exactly 2 decimal points, such as 3.87, etc.  Use data attributes to insure that Email addresses entered into the system conform with the pattern [username]@contoso.edu. Hint: Refer to the regex material in the Galloway book.   Use data attributes to insure that Gpa is expressed as a value in range from 0.7 and 4.0 inclusive.   The Students (Index) view should be sortable ascending and descending according to the LastName column or the GPA column. ","topics":[],"score":214041,"global_rank":248056},{"name":"Asfawh/mezmure_mern","owner":"Asfawh","html_url":"https://github.com/Asfawh/mezmure_mern","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"EOTC Mezmure MERN Web app ","topics":[],"score":214038,"global_rank":248058},{"name":"laijiang19/watchout","owner":"laijiang19","html_url":"https://github.com/laijiang19/watchout","stars":1,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":214035,"global_rank":248070},{"name":"qianwei-yin/react-advanced-tutorial","owner":"qianwei-yin","html_url":"https://github.com/qianwei-yin/react-advanced-tutorial","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":"This is what I do while learning advanced react.","topics":[],"score":214034,"global_rank":248082},{"name":"laualexandrar/TodoList-React","owner":"laualexandrar","html_url":"https://github.com/laualexandrar/TodoList-React","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":214034,"global_rank":248087},{"name":"phamav/Blackjack-strategy","owner":"phamav","html_url":"https://github.com/phamav/Blackjack-strategy","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"JavaScript","description":null,"topics":[],"score":214034,"global_rank":2